<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
      body { font-family: -apple-system, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif; color: #1A202C; background: #F7FAFC; margin: 0; padding: 24px; }
      .wrap { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; overflow: hidden; }
      .hdr { background: #00209F; color: #fff; padding: 20px 24px; }
      .hdr h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; }
      .hdr .sub { font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 4px; }
      .body { padding: 24px; }
      .ref { font-family: "Courier New", monospace; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #00209F; background: #F7FAFC; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px; text-align: center; margin: 16px 0; }
      .bv { background: #F7FAFC; border-left: 4px solid #00209F; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 16px 0; font-size: 14px; }
      .muted { color: #718096; font-size: 13px; }
      .pill { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
      .pill.signed { background: #1F7A3B; }
      .pill.unsigned { background: #B45309; }
      .foot { border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0; padding: 16px 24px; font-size: 11px; color: #718096; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hdr">
        <h1>BonVote — Resi Enskripsyon</h1>
        <div class="sub"><%= @election&.title %></div>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <p>Bonjou <strong><%= @user.full_name.presence || @user.email %></strong>,</p>

        <p>Enskripsyon w pou vote konplete. Men referans ou:</p>

        <div class="ref"><%= @record.voter_reference %></div>

        <% if @record.polling_station.present? %>
          <div class="bv">
            <strong>Biwo Vòt:</strong> BV #<%= @record.polling_station.bv_number %><br>
            <strong>Sant:</strong> <%= @record.polling_station.polling_center&.name %><br>
            <% if @record.polling_station.polling_center&.formatted_address.present? %>
              <span class="muted"><%= @record.polling_station.polling_center.formatted_address %></span><br>
            <% end %>
            <% if @record.polling_station.polling_center&.contact_phone.present? %>
              <strong>Telefòn:</strong>
              <a href="tel:<%= @record.polling_station.polling_center.contact_phone %>" style="color:#0d6efd;text-decoration:none;">
                <%= @record.polling_station.polling_center.contact_phone %>
              </a>
              <% if @record.polling_station.polling_center.contact_hours.present? %>
                <span class="muted">— <%= @record.polling_station.polling_center.contact_hours %></span>
              <% end %>
            <% end %>
          </div>
        <% else %>
          <p class="muted"><em>Biwo vòt ap atribye byento.</em></p>
        <% end %>

        <p>
          <% if @record.bonvote_signature.present? %>
            <span class="pill signed">Siyen pa BonVote · Pwotokòl CEP</span>
          <% else %>
            <span class="pill unsigned">Pa siyen</span>
          <% end %>
        </p>

        <p class="muted">
          <% if @record.bonvote_signature.present? %>
            BonVote bay resi sa a dapre pwotokòl CEP la. Resi PDF la tache nan imèl sa a —
            ou ka enprime l oswa sere l nan telefòn ou.
          <% else %>
            Resi sa a poko siyen. L ap siyen lè enskripsyon w konplete.
          <% end %>
        </p>

        <p>Pote resi a (enprime oswa sou telefòn) jou eleksyon an, ansanm ak yon pyès idantite ofisyèl (CIN oswa paspò).</p>

        <p class="muted"><strong>Pa pataje referans sa a.</strong> Li valab sèlman pou ou menm.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="foot">
        BonVote suiv pwotokòl CEP la. Imèl sa a se yon kopi BonID. Si ou pa t enskri, reponn imèl sa a.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
